# This directory stores raw downloaded data from various sources.
# Files in this directory are typically:
# - nps_parks_raw.json - Raw National Park Service API responses
# - acw_battles_raw.json - Raw ACW battle data
# - wikidata_*.json - Raw Wikidata SPARQL query results
# - wikipedia_*.html - Raw Wikipedia pages

# This file ensures the directory is tracked by git even when empty.
